{"book":"fractions","bookTitle":"Fractions","concept":9,"title":"Dividing fractions","grades":"Grades 7–8","goal":"I can divide fractions and explain how many groups fit.","teach":"Dividing asks “how many groups fit?” To divide by a fraction, multiply by its <b>reciprocal</b> (turn the divisor upside down). The reciprocal of <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"n\">2</span><span class=\"d\">3</span></span> is <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"n\">3</span><span class=\"d\">2</span></span>. Change mixed numbers first. Ask what the answer means: a number of groups, a length or another amount.","tvis":"<div class=\"vis\"><span class=\"vi\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:692px;height:auto\" viewBox=\"0 0 532 116\"><line x1=\"26\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"506\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><line x1=\"26.0\" y1=\"52\" x2=\"26.0\" y2=\"68\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"86.0\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"86.0\" y2=\"65\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"0.9\"/><line x1=\"146.0\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"146.0\" y2=\"65\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"0.9\"/><line x1=\"206.0\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"206.0\" y2=\"65\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"0.9\"/><line x1=\"266.0\" y1=\"52\" x2=\"266.0\" y2=\"68\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"326.0\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"326.0\" y2=\"65\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"0.9\"/><line x1=\"386.0\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"386.0\" y2=\"65\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"0.9\"/><line x1=\"446.0\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"446.0\" y2=\"65\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"0.9\"/><line x1=\"506.0\" y1=\"52\" x2=\"506.0\" y2=\"68\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"26.0\" y=\"84.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">0</text><text x=\"266.0\" y=\"84.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">1</text><text x=\"506.0\" y=\"84.0\" font-family=\"Public S