an></span>, so <span class=\"mx\">1<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"n\">1</span><span class=\"d\">2</span></span></span> ÷ <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"n\">1</span><span class=\"d\">4</span></span> = 6.</div></div>","ex":{"q":"Calculate <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"n\">5</span><span class=\"d\">6</span></span> ÷ <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"n\">2</span><span class=\"d\">3</span></span>.","steps":["Keep <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"n\">5</span><span class=\"d\">6</span></span> and multiply by the reciprocal of <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"n\">2</span><span class=\"d\">3</span></span>, which is <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"n\">3</span><span class=\"d\">2</span></span>.","<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"n\">5</span><span class=\"d\">6</span></span> × <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"n\">3</span><span class=\"d\">2</span></span> = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"n\">15</span><span class=\"d\">12</span></span>.","Simplify: <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"n\">15</span><span class=\"d\">12</span></span> = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"n\">5</span><span class=\"d\">4</span></span> = <span class=\"mx\">1<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"n\">1</span><span class=\"d\">4</span></span></span>."]},"watch":"Turn only the divisor (the second fraction) upside down, never the first one.","qs":[{"text":"Fill in the missing fraction: <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"n\">4</span><span class=\"d\">5</span></span> ÷ ___ = 2","vis":"","parts":[{"t":"box","label":"Missing fraction","a":"2/5","form":"val","o":null}],"hint":"What fraction fits into four fifths exactly 2 times?","steps":"1. Formula: <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"d\">b</span></span> ÷ <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"d\">d</span></span> = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"d\">b</span></span> × <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"d\">c</span></span>. Keep the first fraction, change ÷ to ×, and turn 