label":"Cups","a":"6","form":"val","o":null}],"hint":"Change the juice into eighths of a litre. How many groups of 3 eighths?","steps":"1. Formula: <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"d\">b</span></span> ÷ <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"n\">c</span><span class=\"d\">d</span></span> = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"d\">b</span></span> × <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"d\">c</span></span>. Keep the first fraction, change ÷ to ×, and turn the second fraction upside down (its reciprocal).<br>2. 2<span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"n\">1</span><span class=\"d\">4</span></span> = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"n\">9</span><span class=\"d\">4</span></span><br>3. <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"n\">9</span><span class=\"d\">4</span></span> ÷ <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"n\">3</span><span class=\"d\">8</span></span> = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"n\">9</span><span class=\"d\">4</span></span> × <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"n\">8</span><span class=\"d\">3</span></span> = <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"n\">72</span><span class=\"d\">12</span></span><br>4. = 6 cups"},{"text":"Each bar is one whole cut into thirds. How many thirds fit into 2 wholes? Write the division.","vis":"<div class=\"vis\"><span class=\"vi\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:434px;height:auto\" viewBox=\"0 0 334 72\"><rect x=\"1.0\" y=\"2.0\" width=\"110.0\" height=\"26.0\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"0.9\"/><rect x=\"111.0\" y=\"2.0\" width=\"110.0\" height=\"26.0\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"0.9\"/><rect x=\"221.0\" y=\"2.0\" width=\"110.0\" height=\"26.0\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"0.9\"/><rect x=\"1.0\" y=\"36.0\" width=\"110.0\" height=\"26.0\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"0.9\"/><rect x=\"111.0\" y=\"36.0\" width=\"110.0\" height=\"26.0\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"0.9\"/><rect x=\"221.0\" y=\"36.0\" width=\"110.0\" height=\"26.0\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"0.9\"/></svg></span></div>","self":1,"parts":[{"label":"Thirds in 2 wholes"},{"label":"The division"}],"hint":"Count the thirds in both bars.","steps":"1. Rule: dividing by <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"n\">1</span><span class=\"d\">3</span></span> asks how many thirds fit.<br>2. Each whole has 3 thirds: 2 × 3 = 6 thirds<br>3. 2 ÷ <span class=\"fr\"><span class=\"n\">1</span><span class=\"d\">3</span></span> = 2 × 3 = 6"}]}